1
00:00:37,460 --> 00:00:39,600
[EP23]

2
00:00:49,240 --> 00:00:50,220
Shoot!

3
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:51,420
Xiao Wan,

4
00:00:52,340 --> 00:00:53,320
aim at my heart

5
00:00:53,780 --> 00:00:55,100
for the next shot.

6
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:58,640
Can I

7
00:00:58,640 --> 00:00:59,520
understand that

8
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,520
you love me,

9
00:01:04,820 --> 00:01:06,040
so you didn't kill me,

10
00:01:07,740 --> 00:01:09,120
and just shot me in the leg,

11
00:01:09,540 --> 00:01:10,940
not in the heart?

12
00:01:11,540 --> 00:01:12,580
Chu Nanfeng,

13
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,880
I don't understand why you have to

14
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:15,840
fight Ling Shenxing for everything,

15
00:01:16,460 --> 00:01:17,720
including me.

16
00:01:18,740 --> 00:01:19,540
Because

17
00:01:20,660 --> 00:01:22,340
power is a good thing.

18
00:01:25,480 --> 00:01:27,060
My parents always taught me to be humble.

19
00:01:27,060 --> 00:01:27,860
Nanfeng,

20
00:01:28,820 --> 00:01:30,980
being humble is not to wrong yourself,

21
00:01:31,500 --> 00:01:33,180
but to care about others.

22
00:01:33,380 --> 00:01:36,820
That's the magnanimity of our family.

23
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:40,180
[Nanfeng, you'll be a gentleman.]

24
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:42,020
[A gentleman should be modest.]

25
00:01:42,460 --> 00:01:43,260
[Giving up what you love]

26
00:01:43,260 --> 00:01:45,120
[to others is the most decent thing.]

27
00:01:45,960 --> 00:01:47,180
[Don't be capricious.]

28
00:01:47,940 --> 00:01:49,560
[A good child should know]

29
00:01:50,140 --> 00:01:51,420
[how to behave and give in.]

30
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:54,740
[But I find only those with power can be themselves.]

31
00:01:54,940 --> 00:01:55,840
Father.

32
00:01:56,100 --> 00:01:57,740
The Southwestern Departments are coveting our land.

33
00:01:57,740 --> 00:01:58,760
If our soldiers have no food,

34
00:01:58,760 --> 00:02:00,080
how can they fight?

35
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,200
That's not your concern.

36
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:04,560
Father,

37
00:02:05,060 --> 00:02:05,700
one wrong step

38
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:06,340
leads to another.

39
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,040
Do we want to be condemned by history?

40
00:02:10,200 --> 00:02:11,380
History is written

41
00:02:11,440 --> 00:02:13,360
by those in power.

42
00:02:13,700 --> 00:02:15,900
You've learned nothing

43
00:02:15,940 --> 00:02:17,680
of the gentleman's way I taught you.

44
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,820
The Lings hold military power.

45
00:02:19,900 --> 00:02:21,320
Yet you go against them.

46
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:23,880
Are you trying to ruin our family?

47
00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:26,760
You've offended them.

48
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:28,400
What about your brother?

49
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,300
What about the Chus?

50
00:02:33,140 --> 00:02:34,260
Power.

51
00:02:35,220 --> 00:02:37,020
It's a good thing.

52
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:38,880
Ridiculous.

53
00:02:40,040 --> 00:02:40,840
Chu Nanfeng.

54
00:02:41,500 --> 00:02:43,040
Do you remember the third drink

55
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:45,260
when we first met?

56
00:02:50,500 --> 00:02:51,480
Horse's Neck,

57
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:54,380
also known as Jin Ma Jing in Chinese,

58
00:02:54,680 --> 00:02:55,720
signifying honesty

59
00:02:57,380 --> 00:02:58,560
and keeping one's word.

60
00:02:59,160 --> 00:02:59,960
That drink

61
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,740
also has another meaning,

62
00:03:02,660 --> 00:03:04,080
which is to not play tricks.

63
00:03:04,660 --> 00:03:05,580
I've always been

64
00:03:06,040 --> 00:03:07,180
straightforward with you.

65
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,860
Jinrou should have found the plague prescription.

66
00:03:09,960 --> 00:03:11,600
The people of Yang City will be saved.

67
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,600
Kill him!

68
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:26,660
The plague has spread throughout the city.

69
00:03:28,020 --> 00:03:28,820
You monster!

70
00:03:29,280 --> 00:03:30,020
You deserve it!

71
00:03:30,300 --> 00:03:31,200
You deserve it!

72
00:03:35,480 --> 00:03:36,820
Yes, kill him!

73
00:03:41,780 --> 00:03:43,080
Shoot him!

74
00:03:43,940 --> 00:03:45,460
Shoot his whole family!

75
00:03:46,820 --> 00:03:48,880
Kill him!

76
00:03:53,160 --> 00:03:54,780
Yes, kill him!

77
00:04:03,920 --> 00:04:06,440
Kill him! He caused the plague in our city!

78
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,900
Young Marshal,

79
00:04:10,280 --> 00:04:11,180
in the next life,

80
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:12,820
I'll still be your subordinate.

81
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:14,020
I don't regret

82
00:04:14,140 --> 00:04:14,940
following you.

83
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:22,500
Stop!

84
00:04:23,380 --> 00:04:24,300
Move!

85
00:04:26,300 --> 00:04:27,560
Su Muwan?

86
00:04:27,840 --> 00:04:29,260
Why is she here?

87
00:04:47,680 --> 00:04:48,460
Second Auntie,

88
00:04:49,120 --> 00:04:50,360
are you surprised

89
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:51,680
to see Deputy Zhang?

90
00:04:52,320 --> 00:04:53,820
You thought you poisoned him,

91
00:04:54,160 --> 00:04:55,480
he would lose his memory

92
00:04:55,720 --> 00:04:56,920
and won't tell your secret.

93
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:11,940
Wipe your sweat.

94
00:05:37,260 --> 00:05:38,080
What's going on?

95
00:05:38,580 --> 00:05:39,240
Deputy Zhang,

96
00:05:40,660 --> 00:05:41,480
you have asthma.

97
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:42,520
I still remember.

98
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:50,700
Second Concubine, let me ask you.

99
00:05:50,880 --> 00:05:51,980
Is Ling Shenkang

100
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,880
really the son of you and Commander Ling?

101
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:55,880
Is he the blood of the Ling family?

102
00:06:00,780 --> 00:06:02,880
Shenkang is the son of me and the commander.

103
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:04,520
He is the young master of the Ling family.

104
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,540
I'm talking about

105
00:06:07,180 --> 00:06:09,160
you had an affair with Deputy Zhang

106
00:06:09,500 --> 00:06:10,880
and gave birth to Ling Shenkang.

107
00:06:12,280 --> 00:06:13,720
You two worked together

108
00:06:13,720 --> 00:06:15,380
to kill Commander Ling.

109
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:18,420
and tried to frame the Sus.

110
00:06:20,320 --> 00:06:22,200
You thought poisoning Zhang

111
00:06:22,420 --> 00:06:23,820
would silence him,

112
00:06:24,060 --> 00:06:25,660
but he would've exposed your secrets.

113
00:06:26,140 --> 00:06:27,180
Not only that,

114
00:06:27,540 --> 00:06:29,040
you and Chu Nanfeng

115
00:06:29,360 --> 00:06:31,260
poisoned Yang City's water source,

116
00:06:31,380 --> 00:06:32,500
creating a plague

117
00:06:32,820 --> 00:06:34,460
to weaken the Lings.

118
00:06:34,460 --> 00:06:35,320
Right?

119
00:06:35,960 --> 00:06:38,140
They control all of Yang City's water.

120
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:39,740
Yang City.

121
00:06:40,460 --> 00:06:41,160
Water source.

122
00:06:42,220 --> 00:06:43,660
No wonder the plague spread so fast.

123
00:06:47,540 --> 00:06:49,260
This is really ridiculous.

124
00:06:49,940 --> 00:06:51,080
Where's the evidence?

125
00:06:51,340 --> 00:06:53,020
Who would believe

126
00:06:53,340 --> 00:06:54,400
your empty words?

127
00:06:54,940 --> 00:06:55,740
Evidence?

128
00:06:56,700 --> 00:06:57,960
Deputy Zhang is the evidence.

129
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,140
And

130
00:06:59,740 --> 00:07:00,540
asthma.

131
00:07:02,780 --> 00:07:04,040
Deputy Zhang has asthma.

132
00:07:04,460 --> 00:07:05,720
So does Ling Shenkang.

133
00:07:05,880 --> 00:07:06,940
And this disease

134
00:07:06,940 --> 00:07:08,480
is highly hereditary.

135
00:07:08,780 --> 00:07:09,900
No one in the Ling family

136
00:07:09,920 --> 00:07:10,980
has ever had

137
00:07:10,980 --> 00:07:12,480
asthma.

138
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:13,920
Give me the child.

139
00:07:14,860 --> 00:07:15,460
Give me.

140
00:07:24,700 --> 00:07:27,060
You bitch.

141
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:29,300
You can do such a thing

142
00:07:29,300 --> 00:07:31,000
to tarnish the family's reputation.

143
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,840
I've always been curious

144
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:37,520
why Old Madam Ling

145
00:07:37,520 --> 00:07:38,620
smells of Ghost Vine.

146
00:07:39,300 --> 00:07:40,340
I thought

147
00:07:40,340 --> 00:07:42,000
it was because you accidentally

148
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:44,080
got it on her when you poisoned me.

149
00:07:44,920 --> 00:07:46,160
Now I understand.

150
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:47,520
It's not an accident.

151
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,720
You've been

152
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:49,880
but

153
00:07:50,380 --> 00:07:51,940
you have been poisoning her.

154
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,380
You poison woman.

155
00:07:57,660 --> 00:07:59,180
How dare you poison me?

156
00:08:01,940 --> 00:08:02,540
Mom.

157
00:08:03,420 --> 00:08:05,560
She's framing me.

158
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:07,620
She's so good at talking.

159
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:09,620
You have to believe me.

160
00:08:15,760 --> 00:08:16,440
Second Aunt,

161
00:08:18,260 --> 00:08:19,320
look at this.

162
00:08:21,540 --> 00:08:22,940
I found the letters

163
00:08:23,280 --> 00:08:24,800
I found the love letters

164
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,560
between you and Zhang.

165
00:08:26,980 --> 00:08:28,140
It's full of

166
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,640
your ambition to take over the Ling family

167
00:08:31,020 --> 00:08:32,920
and how to kill the Marshal.

168
00:08:38,180 --> 00:08:40,140
Letters can be forged.

169
00:08:40,640 --> 00:08:41,640
Tell me.

170
00:08:42,280 --> 00:08:43,280
What's the benefit

171
00:08:43,640 --> 00:08:44,820
for me to do this?

172
00:08:45,200 --> 00:08:46,080
Benefit?

173
00:08:47,220 --> 00:08:49,120
You can take over the Ling family's fortune

174
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,540
and make your son

175
00:08:50,800 --> 00:08:52,280
the heir of the Ling family.

176
00:08:52,500 --> 00:08:53,660
Is that the benefit you want?

177
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,800
You've been married into the Ling family for so long,

178
00:08:55,800 --> 00:08:57,060
but you didn't have a son.

179
00:08:57,400 --> 00:08:58,860
You were worried about losing your status.

180
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:00,020
So,

181
00:09:00,240 --> 00:09:01,680
you had an affair with Deputy Zhang

182
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:03,040
and gave birth to Ling Shenkang.

183
00:09:03,680 --> 00:09:04,600
As for me,

184
00:09:04,940 --> 00:09:06,720
I accidentally found out about your affair,

185
00:09:07,260 --> 00:09:08,580
Then you killed me

186
00:09:08,660 --> 00:09:09,680
and framed the Sus.

187
00:09:11,500 --> 00:09:12,540
Don't you think

188
00:09:13,560 --> 00:09:14,780
what a good story it is?

189
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:16,540
Su Muwan,

190
00:09:18,140 --> 00:09:19,620
you always have a good tongue.

191
00:09:21,760 --> 00:09:22,900
It's a pity that

192
00:09:23,580 --> 00:09:24,600
you don't tell stories.

193
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:26,980
If you can't provide solid evidence,

194
00:09:27,460 --> 00:09:29,080
shut up.
